# The Italian Version of the Test Your Memory (TYM-I): A Tool to Detect Mild Cognitive Impairment in the Clinical Setting
## RESULTS
The TYM-I global score correlated with age (p < 0.0001; r = -0.429), years of education (p < 0.0001; r = 0.410), MMSE (p < 0.0001;
r = 0.631), FAB ( p < 0.0001; r = 0.616), and GDS ( p = 0.0211;
r = -0.155) scores.
